<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-WP 213 FOR NINE AT TEA AGAINST N.TVL.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WP 213 FOR NINE AT TEA AGAINST N.TVL.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western Province were 213 for nine at tea on the opening day of their SuperSport Series four-day match against Northern Transvaal at Newlands on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores: Western Province 213-9 in 69 overs (H.D. Ackerman 51, John Commins 74 not out, Rudi Bryson 4-63).</p>
</text>
